    <http://example.org/node/chunk39> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "What security controls and measures would we implement to ensure the protection of sensitive data, and how would we demonstrate compliance with regulatory requirements such as LCB-FT and legal retention and archival obligations for accounting documents?" ;
