    <http://example.org/node/chunk4> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "During the handling and review of a client file, the solution must surface relevant information, recall applicable rules, propose a checklist of verifications and flag potential anomalies for human review (e.g. during the révision des comptes). the solution must support the preparation of recurring documents. No decision or sign-off may be automated.  3.4 Collaboration and mission continuity. The solution must facilitate the continuity of missions between collaborators by enabling relevant information sharing, an understanding of the context of an in-progress client file, and an efficient resumption by another collaborator.  4. Regulatory, professional and legal constraints  4.1 Professional secrecy and confidentiality." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk40> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To address The tender requirements for strict GDPR compliance, professional secrecy, confidentiality of client data, and data sovereignty, we implements robust security controls and measures.  we have achieved ISO 27001 certification since 2023, which covers the development, delivery, and operations of we services, ensuring a high standard of information security management." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk41> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Additionally, we hold ISO 27701 certification, which extends we information security management system to include privacy information management." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk42> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "For data protection, we utilize encryption in transit with TLS 1.3 and encryption at rest with AES-256. we key management is based on EU-based infrastructure, ensuring that sensitive data is handled within EU. we also implement strict partitioning of client files with logical isolation per client and per mission, preventing any cross-client circulation of data." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk43> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To ensure GDPR compliance, we have a Data Protection Officer (DPO) appointed and maintain a data processing register. we data protection agreements (DPAs) are aligned with GDPR Article 28, ensuring that all data processing activities are legally compliant." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk44> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Regarding professional secrecy and confidentiality, we experience in delivering services to clients bound by professional secrecy, including national professional orders, ensures that we understand the importance of maintaining confidentiality and secrecy." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk45> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To comply with LCB-FT (anti-money laundering) obligations, we are familiar with LCB-FT (anti-money laundering) and ensure that we solutions do not undermine a firm's reporting obligations. we control mapping links platform features to applicable obligations, allowing we to produce corresponding audit evidence." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk46> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "For legal retention and archival obligations for accounting documents, we configurable retention policies align with legal archival obligations. we also maintain an audit log of all system activities, ensuring traceability and compliance with regulatory requirements. we hosting partner, OuraneCloud, holds the SecNumCloud qualification at the hosting layer, supporting sovereign hosting of confidential data within EU. holds ensures that sensitive data is stored and processed in a secure environment that meets the highest standards of data sovereignty." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk47> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "By leveraging these security controls and measures, we demonstrate we commitment to protecting sensitive data and complying with regulatory requirements such as GDPR, LCB-FT, and legal retention and archival obligations for accounting documents." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk48> a prov:Entity ;
