    <http://example.org/node/chunk49> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "How would we ensure that we solution does not undermine the firm's anti-money-laundering obligations? Based on we company context, we have experience with contractual expectations of clients bound by professional secrecy. we are familiar with maintaining professional secrecy and confidentiality of client data. we platform IP model is proprietary software owned by Faber IA, licensed to the client under a subscription/usage model, which ensures that we do not compromise the firm's professional obligations." ;
