    <http://example.org/node/chunk5> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The titleholder must ensure strict respect of professional secrecy and confidentiality of client data. Client files must be strictly partitioned; no leakage of data between client files is acceptable.  4.2 Personal-data protection (GDPR). Client and employee personal and financial data must be processed in compliance with Personal-data protection (GDPR). Data must be hosted within the EU, with no transfer outside the EU; sensitive data must be protected (encryption, pseudonymisation where relevant).  4.3 Reliability and traceability of outputs." ;
