    <http://example.org/node/chunk50> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Regarding auditor independence and separation of duties, our solution must respect auditor independence and separation of duties as per the regulatory compliance obligations we monitor, including auditor-independence and separation-of-duties rules for statutory audit. we ensure that we contractual framework does not place Faber IA or Faber IA tooling in a position that could compromise the firm's professional obligations. As for GDPR, we comply with GDPR requirements, including Article 28 processing agreements. we open-source components are licensed under permissive licenses, and we provide an SBOM to the client. we also ensure that client data ownership is respected, and we reversibility plan provides for the return and deletion of client data at the end of the contract." ;
