    <http://example.org/node/chunk51> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "For LCB-FT (Anti-Money Laundering) obligations, we monitor LCB-FT (Anti-Money Laundering) obligations as part of we regulatory compliance function. To ensure that our solution does not undermine the firm's anti-money-laundering obligations, we would work closely with the client to understand the client specific requirements and implement measures that prevent any potential compromise of the firm's anti-money-laundering obligations." ;
