    <http://example.org/node/chunk52> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Regarding legal retention and archival obligations for accounting documents, we comply with legal retention and archival obligations for accounting documents as part of our regulatory compliance function. our solution would be designed to respect legal retention and archival obligations for accounting documents, and we would ensure that all necessary documents are retained and archived in accordance with applicable laws and regulations. In terms of flagging legal risks, we should highlight the importance of respecting professional secrecy, auditor independence, and separation of duties. we should also emphasize the need for close collaboration with the client to ensure that our solution meets the client specific requirements and does not compromise the client anti-money-laundering obligations or other regulatory compliance requirements." ;
