    <http://example.org/node/chunk63> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To meet The client requirements, we can leverage we Atelier platform, which utilizes a Retrieval-augmented generation (RAG) core approach. leverage enables we to generate answers grounded in validated material, ensuring reliability and limiting unsupported generation.  we AI components would focus on hybrid retrieval, re-ranking, query reformulation, multi-document synthesis, structured extraction with source linking, and template-guided drafting. hybrid retrieval, re-ranking, query reformulation, multi-document synthesis, structured extraction with source linking, and template-guided drafting are well-suited to improve productivity by assisting professionals in retrieving regulatory and methodological information, drafting professional documents, and handling client files." ;
