    <http://example.org/node/chunk68> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Optional fine-tuning is available, but data use terms would be defined with the firm and compliance function before any such use. we experience in delivering regulatory-information assistants and claims-handling solutions demonstrates we capability to meet similar requirements in the accounting and audit domain. we can ensure that our solution respects auditor independence, separation of duties, and complies with legal retention and archival obligations for accounting documents." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk69> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "In summary, by leveraging our Atelier platform, which utilizes a Retrieval-augmented generation (RAG) core approach, focusing on explainability, traceability, and reliability, and adopting an iterative innovation strategy, we can design an AI assistance solution that improves productivity and quality of work while preserving professional secrecy and ensuring the reliability of figures." ;
